    abstract member Distinct: ZSet<'TKey,'TWeight> * ZSet<'TKey,'TWeight> -> ZSet<'TKey,'TWeight>

    /// BILINEAR equi-join on the key: matched keys, weights multiplied. Incrementally, each side's delta joins the OTHER side's current integral, so I(out)=I(a) join I(b).
